OL,3,ALong queues after power surge at
OL,4,AStansted Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, a spokesperson for
OL,7,FStansted Airport said: "Due to a power
OL,8,Fsurge earlier today that affected the
OL,9,Fairport and local area, a number of
OL,10,Fairport systems were temporarily
OL,11,Fimpacted."
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
